{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Can you beat it out with Him</b> — The missing he [in תרקיע] is wonders. The שחקים are above the clouds, and they are so called because they are thin air, and it is from ושחקת ממנה הדק. Likewise they are called רק and רקיע, and they are beneath the spheres. The sense is: will you help Him to beat out the שחקים and make them strong and have them be like a cast mirror, so that the light is seen from them."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:53.990192606Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}